	<system>// One ATM and one (arbitrarily behaving) customer per id, one shared bank server.
system ATM, Customer, Bank;
</system>
	<queries>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] not deadlock</formula>
			<comment>The network never deadlocks.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall(i:id_t) (ATM(i).WaitAuth || ATM(i).WaitWd || ATM(i).WaitRev) imply ATM(i).t &lt;= N*BANK_MAX</formula>
			<comment>Bank always answers an ATM (auth, withdrawal or reversal) within N*BANK_MAX seconds, so the reversal retry never fires.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall(i:id_t) not ATM(i).NetError</formula>
			<comment>No ATM ever hits the network timeout (NET_TIMEOUT is large enough for N ATMs).</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>sup{!ATM(0).Idle}: ATM(0).s</formula>
			<comment>Worst-case duration of a customer session.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall(i:id_t) !ATM(i).Idle imply ATM(i).s &lt;= MAX_SESSION</formula>
			<comment>Every customer session finishes within MAX_SESSION seconds.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>!ATM(0).Idle --&gt; ATM(0).Idle</formula>
			<comment>Liveness: every started session eventually ends.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall(i:id_t) ATM(i).Dispensing imply ATM(i).authed</formula>
			<comment>Safety: cash is only dispensed after successful PIN authorization.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall(i:id_t) (ATM(i).Dispensing || ATM(i).CashOut) imply ATM(i).cashPending</formula>
			<comment>Safety: cash is only dispensed for a bank-approved withdrawal.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall(i:id_t) ATM(i).Idle imply !debited[i]</formula>
			<comment>Money safety: when a session ends, every bank debit has either been paid out as cash or reversed.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>E&lt;&gt; ATM(0).CashOut and ATM(1).CashOut</formula>
			<comment>Both ATMs can hand out cash concurrently.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>E&lt;&gt; ATM(0).CardRetained</formula>
			<comment>Card retention (3 wrong PINs or card not taken) is possible.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>E&lt;&gt; ATM(0).CashRetracted</formula>
			<comment>Cash retraction (cash not taken) is possible.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>E&lt;&gt; ATM(0).WaitRev</formula>
			<comment>The debit-reversal path is reachable (approved withdrawal, card not taken).</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>E&lt;&gt; ATM(0).CashRetracted &amp;&amp; debited[0]</formula>
			<comment>Retracted cash is still debited at retraction time (so the reversal is really needed there).</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>sup{ATM(0).WaitAuth}: ATM(0).t</formula>
			<comment>Timing: worst-case wait for the bank to check the PIN.</comment>
		</query>
		<query>
